                        <p class="font-body-md text-on-surface-variant max-w-xl">
                                    Founded as the Council on Library Resources (CLR) with support from the Ford Foundation, our initial mandate was to address the challenges of the burgeoning information age following World War II.
                                </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mt-12 flex items-baseline gap-4">
                        <span class="text-5xl font-display-xl text-[#8E1B3B]">60+</span>
                        <span class="font-label-caps text-stone-500">Years of Infrastructure</span>
