                    <h3 class="font-headline-sm mb-4 italic">The Convergence</h3>
                    <p class="font-body-sm opacity-90">
                                CLR merged with the Commission on Preservation and Access (CPA) to form the Council on Library and Information Resources, unifying preservation with digital innovation.
                            </p>
